le space"]],"deck":2,"blurb":"TT Isle of Man: Ride on the Edge is a motorcycle racing game built around the famous Tourist Trophy road race on the Isle of Man. Its centerpiece is the full Snaefell Mountain Course, a lap of more than 37 miles over public roads lined with walls, houses and hedges. Real riders and bikes from the event appear, and a career mode lets you work your way up.\n\nThe handling leans toward simulation, so it takes practice to keep a bike stable at high speed on narrow, bumpy roads. It offers single-player racing as well as online multiplayer against other riders. It suits motorcycle fans and racing players who want a serious challenge rather than an arcade experience."}}